      },
      {
        "category": "summary",
        "text": "The container image of the csaf-cms-backend provided by the Secvisogram project includes an OpenJDK runtime (Eclipse Temurin 25.0.5+8) that is affected by CVE-2026-114938 (\"Java4Shell\") and the further vulnerabilities CVE-2026-114939 to CVE-2026-114947 fixed in the OpenJDK Critical Patch Update of 2026-11-17. No fixed base image was available at the time of publication.",
        "title": "Summary"
      },
      {
        "category": "description",
        "text": "csaf-cms-backend is the backend of the CSAF content management system. It provides a REST API for managing the lifecycle of CSAF documents.",
        "title": "Product description"
      }
    ],
    "publisher": {
